I'll produce final answer.Below is one possible goal‐model decomposition for the described multi‐robot resource collection and delivery mission. In this design the top‐level goal (G1) offers two alternative branches: one for a single‐robot mission (which itself is decomposed into a collection phase (G2) and a delivery phase (G3) with built‐in fallbacks for low battery conditions) and one for a parallel multi‐robot execution (G4). You can adjust the details (such as the exact battery thresholds or locations) as needed. 

